\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Sensitivity of the inferred SMB to the basal sliding coefficient $\tau _{\mathrm  {ref}}$ on Great Aletsch and Rhône (both at $A=78$). \emph  {velsurf} is the data-assimilation surface-velocity misfit---the only selector available without stakes---while the stake RMSE is the independent validation against the continuous-record averages ($n$ locations per glacier). Column minima per glacier in bold.}}{16}{}\protected@file@percent }
